OL,3,ADemocrats vow to tackle high prices in
OL,4,ACongress as Republicans seek answers
OL,5,Afor bruising midterms loss
OL,6,
OL,7,FSenior Democrats say they will focus on
OL,8,Freducing high prices, accountability
OL,9,Fand ending the Iran war after winning
OL,10,Fcontrol of Congress in the US midterms
OL,12,FDonald Trump says it's "largely true"
OL,13,Fthe Iran war is behind his Republican
OL,14,FParty's defeat, after Vice-President JD
OL,15,FVance directly criticised the conflict
OL,16,Fas "the reason we lost"
OL,18,FMeanwhile, two Senate seats are yet to
OL,19,Fbe called: in Mississippi, the parties
OL,20,Fare locked in an exceptionally tight
OL,21,Frace, while a slow counting process
OL,22,Frumbles on in Alaska
