OL,3,ADemocrats vow to tackle high prices in
OL,4,ACongress as Republicans seek answers
OL,5,Afor bruising midterms loss
OL,6,
OL,7,FOil prices have fallen below $100 a
OL,8,Fbarrel - to their lowest level in two
OL,9,Fmonths - in the wake of the result
OL,11,FThe fallout comes after Democrats swept
OL,12,Fto victory in the midterms, decisively
OL,13,Fwinning back the Senate and the House
OL,14,Ffrom Republicans - see the results in
OL,15,Fmaps
OL,17,FWhat might Trump do next? And how could
OL,18,Fhe thwart Democrats' ambitions in
OL,19,FCongress? BBC Verify explains
